      "comment": "RANSOM (7) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (24.13) at this track in a Bottom Up - Grade 7 over 425m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Form reads well for this. INITIAL CONSULT (2) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing sixth (24.24) at this track latest. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should be thereabouts. JUSTIFY THIS (8) flew the lids from out wide with a slick early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (23.25) over 400m at Geelong. Can do much better this time. ASTON WALSH (1) is back from a break and worth including.",
